    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is facing a disease of unknown origin, resulting in a large number of humans going missing or mutating into monsters that only know killing and eating. The survivors have formed various resistance and self-defense organizations to fight against these monsters in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the protagonist and use bullet hell attacks to eliminate enemies. During battles, the protagonist can acquire and upgrade various additional weapons to enhance combat abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You continue fighting until your stamina runs out (HP reaches zero), then return to the base to upgrade your abilities before heading back into battle.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is facing a disease of unknown origin, resulting in a large number of humans going missing or mutating into monsters that only know killing and eating. The survivors have formed various resistance and self-defense organizations to fight against these monsters in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the protagonist and use bullet hell attacks to eliminate enemies. During battles, the protagonist can acquire and upgrade various additional weapons to enhance combat abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You continue fighting until your stamina runs out (HP reaches zero), then return to the base to upgrade your abilities before heading back into battle.</p>",
